ars from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 45% of normal in Nov-Dec and 186% in May-Jun. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, and grid 16376 fell to 45% that year.</p>"}
